@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of use";
}
<div class="container py-4">
    <article class="prose">
        <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
        <h1>Terms of use</h1>
        <p>Rentilo is a meeting place for people who want to rent items from each other. Agreements about a rental are made between the renter and the owner.</p>
        <h2>Listing items</h2>
        <p>Only list items you own and are allowed to rent out. Describe them honestly, including any defects. Don't list anything illegal, dangerous or that requires a licence to use.</p>
        <h2>Renting items</h2>
        <p>Treat items with care and return them on time and in the same condition. If something breaks, tell the owner right away.</p>
        <h2>Reviews</h2>
        <p>Reviews must be honest and based on a real rental. We may remove reviews that are abusive or misleading.</p>
        <h2>Accounts</h2>
        <p>Keep your password safe. We may suspend accounts that break these terms.</p>
    </article>
</div>
